{"step_index":56,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-18T13:08:57Z","thinking":"**Creating App.tsx and Index.ts**\n\nI'm now focusing on implementing the core application files. I'm building `App.tsx` with SQLite database initialization and sample data seeding for a first-launch experience. This will provide users with immediate access to the Power Dialer's HUD flow. The AppNavigator will then be rendered.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import React, { useEffect, useState } from 'react';\nimport { View, ActivityIndicator, StyleSheet, StatusBar } from 'react-native';\nimport { SafeAreaProvider } from 'react-native-safe-area-context';\nimport AppNavigator from './src/navigation/AppNavigator';\nimport { getDatabase } from './src/db/database';\nimport { LeadsRepository } from './src/db/leadsRepository';\nimport { VisionService } from './src/services/visionService';\n\nexport default function App() {\n  const [dbReady, setDbReady] = useState(false);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    async function setup() {\n      try {\n        await getDatabase();\n        // Check if there are any lists; if none, seed a demo list for quick out-of-the-box testing\n        const existingLists = await LeadsRepository.getAllLists();\n        if (existingLists.length === 0) {\n          const sampleLeads = VisionService.getDemoExtractedLeads();\n          await LeadsRepository.createListWithLeads(\n            'Demo Trade Show Roster',\n            null,\n            sampleLeads\n          );\n        }\n      } catch (err) {\n        console.error('Failed to initialize database:', err);\n      } finally {\n        setDbReady(true);\n      }\n    }\n    setup();\n  }, []);\n\n  if (!dbReady) {\n    return (\n      <View style={styles.loadingScreen}>\n        <StatusBar barStyle=\"light-content\" backgroundColor=\"#0F172A\" />\n        <ActivityIndicator size=\"large\" color=\"#3B82F6\" />\n      </View>\n    );\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <SafeAreaProvider>\n      <StatusBar barStyle=\"light-content\" backgroundColor=\"#0F172A\" />\n      <AppNavigator />\n    </SafeAreaProvider>\n  );\n}\n\nconst styles = StyleSheet.create({\n  loadingScreen: {\n    flex: 1,\n    backgroundColor: '#0F172A',\n    justifyContent: 'center',\n    alignItems: 'center',\n  },\n});\n","Description":"App.tsx root component with database initialization and seed data setup","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer\\App.tsx","toolAction":"Writing root App.tsx","toolSummary":"Write App.tsx"}}]}
